18.9 Relations with Complete Elliptic Integrals \(K\) and \(K^{\prime}\) and Their Parameter \(m\)

and with Jacobi's Elliptic Functions (see chapter 16)

(Here \(K\!(m)\) and \(K^{\prime}(m)\!=\!\!K(1\!-\!m)\) are complete elliptic integrals of the 1st kind; see chapter 17.)

\(\Delta\!\!>\!0\)\(\Delta\!\!<\!0\)

18.9.1 \(e_{1}\!\!=\!\!\frac{(2\!-\!m)K^{2}\!(m)}{3\omega^{2}}\)\(e_{1}\!\!=\!\!\frac{(2\!-\!1)\!+\!6i\sqrt{m\!-\!m^{2}}}{3\omega_{2}^{2}}\! \cdot\!\!K^{2}\!(m)\)

18.9.2 \(e_{2}\!\!=\!\!\frac{(2\!-\!1)\!K^{2}\!(m)}{3\omega^{2}}\)\(e_{2}\!\!=\!\!\frac{2(1\!-\!2m)\!K^{2}\!(m)}{3\omega_{2}^{4}}\)

18.9.3 \(e_{3}\!\!=\!\!\frac{(m\!+\!1)\!K^{2}\!(m)}{3\omega^{2}}\)\(e_{3}\!\!=\!\!\frac{(2\!-\!1)\!-\!6i\sqrt{m\!-\!m^{2}}}{3\omega_{2}^{4}} \cdot\!\!K^{2}\!(m)\)

18.9.4 \(g_{2}\!\!=\!\!\frac{4(m^{2}\!-\!m\!+\!1)\!K^{4}\!(m)}{3\omega^{4}}\)\(g_{2}\!\!=\!\!\frac{4(16m^{2}\!-\!16m\!+\!1)\!K^{4}\!(m)}{3\omega_{2}^{4}}\)

18.9.5 \(g_{3}\!\!=\!\!\frac{4(m\!-\!2)(2m\!-\!1)(m\!+\!1)\!K^{6}\!(m)}{27\omega^{4}}\)\(g_{3}\!\!=\!\!\frac{8(2m\!-\!1)(32m^{2}\!-\!32m\!-\!1)\!K^{6}\!(m)}{27 \omega_{2}^{4}}\)

18.9.6 \(\Delta\!\!=\!\!\frac{16m^{2}\!(m\!-\!1)^{2}\!K^{13}\!(m)}{\omega^{2}}\)\(\Delta\!\!=\!\!\frac{-256(m\!-\!m^{2})\!K^{12}\!(m)}{\omega_{2}^{1}}\)

18.9.7 \(\omega^{\prime}\!\!=\!\!\frac{iK^{\prime}(m)\omega}{K(m)}\)\(\omega_{2}^{\prime}\!\!=\!\!\frac{iK^{\prime}(m)\omega_{2}}{K(m)}\)

18.9.8 \(\omega\!\!=\!\!K(m)/(\!e_{1}\!-\!e_{3}\!)^{1/2}\)\(\omega_{2}\!\!=\!\!K(m)/\!H_{2}^{\prime/2}\)

18.9.9 \(m\!\!=\!(e_{2}\!-\!e_{3})/(e_{1}\!-\!e_{3})\)\(m\!\!=\!\!\frac{1}{2}\!-\!\frac{3e_{2}}{4H_{2}}\)

18.9.10 [0\(\!<\!m\!\leq\!\!1\), since \(g_{3}\!\geq\!0\)]

